	quest.687A08FCC2CA7ADE.title: "Upgraded Energy Conduits"
	quest.697350F554C4BD08.quest_desc: ["Used to craft tier 3 seeds."]
	quest.69ADBF0817B66976.quest_desc: ["A powerful crafting material!"]
	quest.69B30B7931FFA9C2.quest_desc: ["Crafted using the Empowerer. See JEI."]
	quest.69C0C3BBFDE9F3C4.quest_desc: ["Obtained by hammering sand."]
	quest.69E913700895176C.quest_desc: [
		"A vat for alchemical digestion, required for exaltation."
		""
		"See The Hermetica for more details on Theurgy."
	]
	quest.6A7D872DC35ADB7D.quest_desc: ["Refer to &oThe Big Book of Bees&r for in-game documentaion, as well as JEI for recipes and breeding information. Buzz Buzz!"]
	quest.6AAAD7E763058DF2.quest_desc: ["Extends your reach to the terminal. 16 blocks distance."]
	quest.6AD13F2C74133847.quest_desc: ["The Angel Ring mod adds an Angel Ring, which allows you to fly, like in a creative mode to help with building/travelling. Inspired by Extra Utilities' Angel Ring."]
	quest.6BC645CB89B3B4C5.quest_desc: ["Get rid of excess items, fluids, and energy."]
	quest.6BC645CB89B3B4C5.title: "Trash Cans"
	quest.6C04BB45701F2822.quest_desc: ["The Metallurgic Infuser is the first step in the Mekanism tech tree. The Metallurgic Infuser is a machine used in the production of Steel Ingots, Bronze Ingot, Enriched Alloy, and Obsidian Ingots. "]
	quest.6C17B46F1A1CC3DE.quest_desc: [
		"Hammers let you crush cobblestone and other materials into their crushed varients. Hammers can be enchanted. Better hammers also exist, see JEI."
		""
		"Try hammering logs to obtain wood chippings - great for compost!"
	]
	quest.6C58685A51851C37.quest_desc: [
		"A device to extract Alchemical Salt from items."
		""
		"Place the oven on top of the braizer. Fill the braizer with blaze rods to heat the oven!"
		""
		"See The Hermetica for more details on Theurgy."
	]
	quest.6C6E2A02FB248AE9.quest_desc: ["Extracts liquid latex from logs. Put next to a tree to start extracting. See JEI for rates."]
	quest.6CA1FE2FD5E868FB.quest_desc: ["Meshes are used in sieves (and compressed sieves) to obtain resources by sifting various blocks. Meshes can be enchanted with efficiency and fortune. See JEI for a list of drops."]
	quest.6CD669C30C0AA09C.quest_desc: ["Clouds can be found in the Aether's skies!"]
	quest.6CD669C30C0AA09C.title: "Aether Aerclouds"
	quest.6D6FB6C12C6D5998.quest_desc: ["Upgraded versions of item conduits!"]
	quest.6D6FB6C12C6D5998.title: "Upgraded Item Conduits"
	quest.6DCE8E2F8BE302FA.quest_desc: ["Crafting ingredient to create Warden tools and armor."]
	quest.6DDFDEC9A735CC6C.quest_desc: ["Upgraded versions of fluid conduits!"]
	quest.6DDFDEC9A735CC6C.title: "Upgraded Fluid Conduits"
	quest.6DE98C7BF96D2C00.quest_desc: [
		"Max Blocks: 9"
		""
		"Construction Sticks allow you to place multiple blocks at once, extending your build in the direction you're facing. You can upgrade your stick to enhance its abilities, making construction faster and more efficient."
		""
		"There are five different tiers of Construction Sticks: Wood, Copper, Iron, Diamond, and Netherite. Each tier offers improved durability and block placement abilities, and can be further upgraded with templates."
	]
	quest.6E00BEC4F2B3C57B.quest_desc: ["A rare gem, found only in the sky islands of the Aether"]
	quest.6E00D8F37E6E5FB5.quest_desc: [
		"The Controller powers the storage network."
		""
		"Each network requires at least one Controller to stay active. Multiple Controllers can be used to meet higher energy demands."
	]
	quest.6E483CB95EE50A39.quest_desc: ["Quartz Enriched Iron is used to craft various storage network devices."]
	quest.6EA1765FCF1115A7.quest_desc: ["Sieve compressed blocks to save on space and efficiency!"]
	quest.6F0876FC8A6A3D40.quest_desc: ["Maximize smelting efficiency with unparalleled speed, reconfigurable sides, augments for smoking and blasting, and much more."]
	quest.6F15A0072CC62A53.quest_desc: ["Crafted using Zanite Gemstones, the Altar can be used to enchant Gravitite Ore."]
	quest.6F444A1F89D19FF8.quest_desc: ["Can be smelted into plastic."]
	quest.6F4CC9A97F52FB72.quest_desc: [
		"The Mob Masher is a block used to maximise mob drops by being modular with several upgrade options."
		"Vanilla enchants are available as upgrades beyond normal levels."
	]
	quest.70D8ED7A0468756E.quest_desc: [
		"Place the Flux Crafter in-world and right-click to view the GUI. Inside there's a 3x3 crafting grid, similar to a Crafting Table. Place your recipe ingredients into the grid."
		""
		"If the recipe is correct, the Flux Crafter should start to take energy from all Flux Alternators placed within a 4 block radius. You can tell if they're working if they are emitting particle effects."
	]
	quest.7150EF5B50D9E2DE.quest_desc: [
		"Max Blocks: 3"
		""
		"See information tab in JEI to learn about different features, including how to undo placements!"
		""
		"Construction Sticks allow you to place multiple blocks at once, extending your build in the direction you're facing. You can upgrade your stick to enhance its abilities, making construction faster and more efficient."
		""
		"There are five different tiers of Construction Sticks: Wood, Copper, Iron, Diamond, and Netherite. Each tier offers improved durability and block placement abilities, and can be further upgraded with templates."
	]
	quest.7150EF5B50D9E2DE.title: "Construction Sticks"
	quest.720725F7A69975DC.quest_desc: [
		"Check the Bumblezone advancements tab for what to do!"
		""
		"Entering the dimension is super easy! Just throw an Enderpearl at any Bee Nest or Beehive (even modded ones works!) to enter inside it and spawn into the dimension. You can also make yourself (riding a mob or vehicle) or any mob enter the dimension by using a piston to push the player or mob into a Beehive or Bee Nest block! (Be sure to surround the contraption so the piston doesn't push the mob sideways instead of into the hive block) To teleport out of the dimension, you can either dig down and fall below Y = 0 (don't worry, you won't die as I made sure of that) or climb your way to above Y = 256. And yes, you can be riding a mob or vehicle to have them exit the dimension with you or you can push them out of push to get them out of the dimension. The mod will try to put the mob or player back in the original spot and original dimension they were at when they attempted to enter the Bumblezone dimension. If a mob that originated in Bumblezone tries to exit, they will be placed at 0,0 spot in Overworld so you can find them."
	]
	quest.720725F7A69975DC.title: "Into the Bumblezone"
	quest.7240C8B55A47F4E2.quest_desc: ["Use the Quantum Compressor to create singularities. Then you can combine all the different singularities into the Ultimate Singularity!"]
	quest.7274D9FE55036285.quest_desc: ["Extends your range even further to 64 blocks. This distance is lengthened with the addition of a beacon (hold shift on item for details)."]
	quest.729B2C9F29E2831E.quest_desc: ["Uses liquids and items to craft things. See JEI for all uses."]
	quest.72AC9F164CB96893.quest_desc: ["Use on a chicken to create a rotten egg. Click the egg on a 5x5 dirt patch to create dreadful dirt (spawns hostile mobs when dark)."]
	quest.72C4BBB26B744471.quest_desc: ["Bio-Generators produce electricity from Bio Fuel."]
	quest.7337E3E0D860BF06.quest_desc: ["Generates power by burning fuel, upgradable."]
	quest.73A75F0B58AE8A65.quest_desc: [
		"Each Quantum Compressor recipe usually requires a Catalyst item and some quantity of ingredients. Place the Catalyst in the far left slot and the ingredients into the slot next to it. You can hover over the blue bar to see the current ingredient as well as how many of that item are in the Compressor. If the combination of Catalyst and ingredient has an output, it will show the progress to creating the resulting item."
		""
		"The Quantum Compressor requires power to function. It will only use power when creating the resulting item."
	]
	quest.7547C2E7492465D0.quest_desc: ["The Ender IO version of solar power."]
	quest.7559977A9DF3218A.quest_desc: ["Crafted using the Atomic Reconstructor. See JEI."]
	quest.75EFA7134FE27200.quest_desc: ["Used to craft Awakened Supremium armor, tools, and weapons."]
	quest.761EC1EF5102E187.quest_desc: [
		"Simple vanilla style storage mod."
		""
		"Features:"
		"Storage and Crafting Terminal"
		"Inventory Connector"
		"Open Crate"
		"Wireless terminal"
		"Filtered connectors"
		"Inventory Hopper"
	]
	quest.761EC1EF5102E187.title: "Simple Storage"
	quest.76250FBFFFE305DC.quest_desc: ["Tier 4 upgrade. What about a tier 5?"]
	quest.76631B8F2A23315E.quest_desc: ["Use in a compressed sieve."]
	quest.76631B8F2A23315E.title: "Compressed Blocks"
	quest.7677AE597AFF69A8.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 upgrade."]
	quest.7689C5F845CA684B.quest_desc: ["Advanced Processor is used to craft various storage network devices."]
	quest.76A6B9C436C4DE48.quest_desc: [
		"Transports energy. Can be placed in the same block as other Ender IO conduits."
		""
		"Note: EnderIO cables are known to sometimes cause lag. If you experience this, consider switching to a different cable type."
	]
	quest.76E19350A24F5C34.quest_desc: ["Catalysts are crafting components that will be needed to craft creative items."]
	quest.76EAB7316C42D03D.quest_desc: ["Excellent for boss fights!"]
	quest.76EAB7316C42D03D.title: "Did Someone Say Apples?"
	quest.772152C611738C41.quest_desc: [
		"Check the Bumblezone advancements tab for what to do!"
		""
		"The Bumblezone is a bee dimension filled with many brand new bee-related blocks! There's even quite a few structures to explore and a unique bee armor you can obtain! If you are lucky, you may find a special Throne-Locating Honey Compasses from certain structures that leads you to a Bee Queen! The dimension itself looks like it is the inside of a bee nest and you will find giant walls in rows with canals of water between them. Maybe you'll even find a pollen covered section of the dimension or a canyon full of massive honey-based crystals! "
		" "
	]
	quest.7792DA152775B422.quest_desc: ["Upgraded version of the exporter. 18 filter slots."]
	quest.781FD27F15C7AC74.quest_desc: ["Turns vanilla storage into sophisticated storage. Click upgrade on storage to apply."]
	quest.7885E80B57B3648C.quest_desc: ["More storage! Hover over the item to see slot and stack capacity."]
	quest.788FA7FED314751F.quest_desc: ["Extended Crafting Tables are a set of tiered Crafting Tables that can be used to craft a variety of items. Each tier has a larger grid which can be used to craft higher tier items with more components."]
	quest.78A7EDF84C87ACC9.quest_desc: ["The Advanced Solar Generator is a highly upgraded version of the basic Solar Generator. Construction of an Advanced Solar Generator requires four Solar Generators, but it produces six times the power of its smaller counterpart. It also requires an area of 3x3x3 Blocks in order to be placed."]
	quest.78FBD1FF4D95E5CF.quest_desc: ["Top tier mystical agriculture gear. Consider using augments to make them even better (Hint: look up flight augment in JEI)."]
	quest.78FBD1FF4D95E5CF.title: "Awakened Gear"
	quest.792903A29197CAB5.quest_desc: ["See JEI for a list of drops."]
	quest.794CFF8CC9FC521D.quest_desc: [
		"Industrial Foregoing includes various machines, utilities, tools and components, used for generating energy, farming, storage, and many other things. Its features are documented in Industrial Foregoing's Manual. "
		"Tier 1 Machine Frame."
	]
	quest.794CFF8CC9FC521D.title: "Industrial Foregoing"
	quest.798CB63BBD46CC3B.quest_desc: [
		"The Grid allows access to the resources stored in the storage network."
		""
