		"See The Hermetica for more details on Theurgy."
	]
	quest.7BD9F9832DA623FD.quest_desc: ["Immersive Engineering multiblock machine. Assemble as a 3x3 and right-click with the engineer's hammer. Just like the blast furnace, but better!"]
	quest.7BD9F9832DA623FD.title: "Reinforced Blast Furnace"
	quest.7C404187C98D4C14.quest_desc: [
		"There are six crafting crystals to Mystical Agriculture, instead of just two. The crystals are: Inferium, Prudentium, Tertium, Imperium, Supremium, and the Master Infusion Crystal."
		""
		"The recipes for the crystals are nested, so you can't just jump to a higher crystal without crafting the previous tier."
	]
	quest.7C6D7C2E30F0A221.quest_desc: ["Use the Atomic Reconstructor and the Empowerer to turn minerals into powerful crystals that allow the creation of useful machines for processing and sorting items, lasers for wirelessly transporting energy, items and fluids, renewable oil to generate power, and much more."]
	quest.7CCA20E6409CE3D9.quest_desc: [
		"Max Blocks: 128"
		""
		"Construction Sticks allow you to place multiple blocks at once, extending your build in the direction you're facing. You can upgrade your stick to enhance its abilities, making construction faster and more efficient."
		""
		"There are five different tiers of Construction Sticks: Wood, Copper, Iron, Diamond, and Netherite. Each tier offers improved durability and block placement abilities, and can be further upgraded with templates."
	]
	quest.7DCE27D2B8070C57.quest_desc: ["Nether Wart can be found in a Nether Fortress."]
	quest.7DD76280E32ED759.quest_desc: ["A portal to another void world. And a block that is bigger on the inside. And a portal to a dark, hostile land with ores to mine."]
	quest.7DD76280E32ED759.title: "Void, Hyperbox, and Deep Dark"
	quest.7DF088A96AE979ED.quest_desc: ["Dragon Eggs can be obtained after defeating the Ender Dragon."]
	quest.7E02FEEC5FDEFDA9.quest_desc: [
		"Max Blocks: 27"
		""
		"Construction Sticks allow you to place multiple blocks at once, extending your build in the direction you're facing. You can upgrade your stick to enhance its abilities, making construction faster and more efficient."
		""
		"There are five different tiers of Construction Sticks: Wood, Copper, Iron, Diamond, and Netherite. Each tier offers improved durability and block placement abilities, and can be further upgraded with templates."
	]
	quest.7EE9136781910742.quest_desc: ["Refer to &oThe Big Book of Bees&r for in-game documentaion, as well as JEI for recipes and breeding information. Buzz Buzz!"]
	quest.7FAB35EDD3B35E25.quest_desc: ["Storage parts can be used in crafting to create storage disks or storage blocks. As they increase in tier, the more stuff you can fit in them!"]
	quest.7FFD3F8E2774C701.quest_desc: ["Used to craft tier 4 seeds."]
